onaname": "cyka6artb", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198248888698/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 12897, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3864, "last_played": 1773017102, "avatar": "8df3fbb9717a9433d4c709138700c25228676cb9"}, "language": "english", "review": "its a sick game and i like it but the only thing i dont like is the sh#t tone of extra money i gotta spend on all the dlc also im from australia so its even more. so, people get this and the dlc when its on sale because that is when you truly have fun\nstill a good game. but if you a combat role play server like the ones soviet womble plays on there arent any i recommend playing co-op though because theres enough servers to satisfy everyone and some of them like the strayagaming tanoa/malden is super leniant because its so small and theres no admins that go on it but for like half the time you need the apex dlc which costs just a little less then the games itself still i got in on sale", "timestamp_created": 1525728873, "timestamp_updated": 1525728873, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "41910449", "author": {"steamid": "76561198184820011", "personaname": "Some Shark Girl", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198184820011/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 24, "playtime_forever": 39813, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 15307, "last_played": 1788556158, "avatar": "636b3d9c37ef7835a680351274068c4ab5eb018f"}, "language": "english", "review": "Love freaking out as I see a group of tanks pull up around a corner and aim at me, really brings the feel of \"oh ♥♥♥♥ oh ♥♥♥♥ oh ♥♥♥♥!\" or bouncing grenades off the wall cause ya miss threw and your squad and you scramble for the exit yelling, revealing your position to the enemy. All in all good game, really fun to play and gives funny moments to look back at", "timestamp_created": 1525722804, "timestamp_updated": 1610933704, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "41910297", "author": {"steamid": "76561198377652435", "personaname": "The 303 Unit", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198377652435/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 42109, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 28275, "last_played": 1676345231, "avatar": "d68761278292c80c7ccade928ec264b10bcb4dae"}, "language": "english", "review": "In my opinion......  It is currently the best Military Sim (infantry, and other aspects) I have played to date!  Excellent Campaigns, and many, many, many game mods and scenarios to choose from.  This game is why I broke-down, and purchased a PC!\n\n     Other than their being a huge learning curve to the game...  It's one of my favorite FPS, and TPS shooters out there!  Oh, Arma 3 also has helicopters, jets, tanks and cars (too many vehicles to mention).  Hope this review helps you make your decision making process a little easier!!\n\n     Graphics-9 out of 10\n    \n                                                         OZ303", "timestamp_created": 1525722166, "timestamp_updated": 1637891737, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": fal